          %div
            %h3#cartan_structural_equations_and_bianchi_identities Cartan structural equations and Bianchi identities
            %p
              On
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cartan+structural+equations"} Cartan structural equations
              and their
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bianchi+identities"} Bianchi identities
              for
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/curvature"} curvature
              and
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/torsion"} torsion
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cartan+moving+frames"} Cartan moving frames
              and (
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cartan+connection"}> Cartan
              \-)
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/connection+on+a+bundle"} connections
              on
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tangent+bundles"} tangent bundles
              (especially in
              = succeed "):" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/first-order+formulation+of+gravity"} first-order formulation of gravity
            %p The original account:
            %ul
              %li#Cartan1923
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%C3%89lie+Cartan"}> Élie Cartan
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Sur les variétés à connexion affine et la théorie de la relativité généralisée (première partie)
                %strong 40
                (1923) 325-412 [
                %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/item?id=ASENS_1923_3_40__325_0"}> doi:ASENS_1923_3_40__325_0
                ]
            %p Historical review:
            %ul
              %li#Scholz19
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Erhard+Scholz"}> Erhard Scholz
                , §2 in:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em E. Cartan’s attempt at bridge-building between Einstein and the Cosserats – or how translational curvature became to be known as “torsion”
                %strong 44
                (2019) 47-75 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1140/epjh/e2018-90059-x"}> doi:10.1140/epjh/e2018-90059-x
                ]
            %p Further discussion:
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shiing-Shen+Chern"}> Shiing-Shen Chern
                  , p. 748 of:
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em A Simple Intrinsic Proof of the Gauss-Bonnet Formula for Closed Riemannian Manifolds
                  %strong 45
                  4 (1944) 747-752 [
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.2307/1969302"}> doi:10.2307/1969302
                  ]
              %li#CastellaniDAuriaFre
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Leonardo+Castellani"}> Leonardo Castellani
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Riccardo+D%27Auria"} Riccardo D'Auria
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pietro+Fr%C3%A9"} Pietro Fré
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em
                      %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Supergravity+and+Superstrings+-+A+Geometric+Perspective"} Supergravity and Superstrings - A Geometric Perspective
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/0224"} doi:10.1142/0224
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/CDF91-TOC.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
                  = succeed "]" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/CastellaniDAuriaFre-ChI2.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
              %li
                %p
