                  ]
              %li
                %p
                  C. C. Briggs,
                  %em A Sequence of Generalizations of Cartan’s Conservation of Torsion Theorem
                  [
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/gr-qc/9908034"}> arXiv:gr-qc/9908034
                  ]
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Loring+Tu"}> Loring Tu
                  , §22 in:
