                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/S0219887817500013"}> doi:10.1142/S0219887817500013
                  ,
                  = succeed "]" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1501.01123"} arXiv:1501.01123
              %li
                %p
                  Ivo Terek Couto,
                  %em Cartan Formalism and some computations
